00:16:53.000 --> 00:17:02.000
That already you have added all the relevant information in your context

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.000
You have all the relevant information

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.000
Now you have to choose your LLM

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.000
That it will follow the given information in this context

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.000
Or it will follow its parametric knowledge

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:18.000
So here comes your LLM's capability of in-context learning

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.000
Or in simple words

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.000
How capable your LLM is

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:26.000
